        "`V` is `C::Linear` and `T` is `C::Raw`, both spelled out (as [Niched](crate::niche::Niched)\'s `V` and `T` are) so",
        "a `Coded` reads the value it holds and the bytes it is without following the trait: a G.711 μ-law byte is",
